        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Ain't no respect for nothin', voice recordin' our discussions",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Her, him, they, them, or anybody, I don't trust 'em at—",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "At all (Noid), some pray for my fall (Noid)",
